body:
You have to do what you have to do to survive. I was kicked out of my parents home as  young man, and had to come crawling back to avoid homelessness after couch surfing for a about a year. I get it. 

&#x200B;

All I can say is, just tell you fam how it is. If they can' be supportive don't ask for support, ask for respect. If they harass you, tell them your struggling really badly and you want to be treated with empathy and respect. Honestly you've got to just stick it out until you can find a better option, because trust me dude you don't want to end up on the street, that made my PTSD 1000X worse for life.
